              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yosuwa ari hafi y’i Yeriko, agize ngw arunamura amaso, abona umuntu imbere yiwe, yāsokōye inkota, ayifashe mu ntoke. Yosuwa aramwēgēra, aramubaza, ati Mbeg’ ur’ ūje ku ruhande rwacu, canke ku rw’abansi bacu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
