              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramwishura, at’ Ekāye: arikw ikinzanye ubu n’uko nd’ umugabisha w’ingabo z’Uhoraho. Maze Yosuwa arapfukama, arūnama, amuha icubahiro, aramubaza, ati Mugenzi, jewe umusavyi wawe non’ ico ugomba kumbarira n’iki? ",
          "type": "text",
