          "text": "Nuk’ uwo mugabisha w’ingabo z’Uhoraho yishura Yosuwa, ati Kūra inkweto mu birenge vyawe, kukw aho hantu uhagaze ar’ ahēra. Nuko Yosuwa abigenza artyo.",
